  unitName: Charlotte (Omni)
  unitId: 820388
  unitNumber: 8239
  description: (Grand Gaia Version) A knight of the Kingdom of Grandshelt, Charlotte
    often finds it difficult to maintain her composure around Rain and Lasswell,
    as many of their conversations quickly turn into complaints on her behalf about
    Rain. However, she constantly found herself worried about both of them regardless,
    which caused her spirit to take physical form and begin following them during
    their adventures. Balancing the needs of her friends and her concerns for the
    kingdom she served worlds away, Charlotte saw no other option but to continue
    fighting to protect those around her. As a knight of Grandshelt, she would never
    allow herself to hesitate, no matter where her journey lead her.
  summonDesc: Thank you for the assistance. A friendly face is always welcome.
  fusionDesc: As a knight of Grandshelt, I will use this power to help others.
  evoDesc: Duty and honor are principles I treasure above all else. However, comradery
    may be important as well...
